            {
              "label": "Talk about family",
              "pattern": "He is… · She is… · They are…",
              "examples": [
                "She is my mother.",
                "He is my father.",
                "They are my grandparents."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "tip": "Escucha, repite y fíjate en la frase completa. Usa el modelo para crear tu propia frase."
